Package: financial
Type: Package
Title: Financial-Structure Extensions for Merger Simulation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Date: 2026-09-10
Authors@R: c(person("Charles", "Taragin", email = "ctaragin+antitrustr@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre")))
Maintainer: Charles Taragin <ctaragin+antitrustr@gmail.com>
Depends: R (>= 4.0), antitrust
Imports: methods, BB, nleqslv, cubature, numDeriv, stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Description: Two disjoint financial-structure merger model families built
    on top of the 'antitrust' structural-fit contract: a debt / limited-
    liability module (firm-level debt reshaping conditional demand shares
    through the outside-share threshold) and a bank liquidity / stability
    module (endogenous marginal-cost shifter driven by liquidity stress).
    Depends only on 'antitrust'; ships its own constructors and lifecycle
    methods rather than reusing antitrust's internal calibration registry.
